[2026-03-16T00:08:42.918Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012gJitTVRcrNZ2cUtRXjuqV","type":"tool_result","content":"100-#### Test: Search bar displays all input fields on load\n101-- **Initial state:** User navigates to the home page (`/`).\n102:- **Expected:** The search bar is visible at the top of the page containing four inputs: a location text input with placeholder \"Where are you going?\", a check-in date picker, a check-out date picker, and a guest count selector. A search/submit button with a magnifying glass icon is visible.\n103-\n104-#### Test: Search by location filters property results\n--\n119-#### Test: Combined search with all fields filters results\n120-- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Multiple properties exist with varying locations, availability, and guest capacities.\n121:- **Action:** User types \"New York\" in the location field, selects check-in \"2026-05-10\" and check-out \"2026-05-15\", sets guests to 3, and clicks the search button.\n122-- **Expected:** The property grid shows only properties in New York that are available for those dates and accommodate at least 3 guests.\n123-\n--\n142-- **Expected:** Dates on or before \"2026-04-10\" are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected. Only dates after the check-in date are selectable.\n143-\n144:#### Test: Guest count selector enforces minimum of 1\n145-- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n146:- **Action:** User interacts with the guest count selector.\n147:- **Expected:** The minimum selectable value is 1. The user cannot set the guest count to 0 or a negative number.\n148-\n149-### Component: CategoryFilter\n--\n485-- **Expected:** The booking card contains a check-in date picker and a check-out date picker. Both are initially empty or show placeholder text.\n486-\n487:#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n488-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 6.\n489:- 