Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 4.\n531-- **Action:** User tries to set the guest count higher than 4.\n532:- **Expected:** The guest count selector prevents selecting more than 4 guests. The maximum is capped at 4.\n533-\n534-#### Test: Guest count minimum is 1\n535-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n536:- **Action:** User interacts with the guest count selector.\n537:- **Expected:** The minimum selectable value is 1. The user cannot set guests to 0 or a negative number.\n538-\n539-#### Test: Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n--\n547-- **Expected:** The booking card remains visible in a sticky sidebar position as the user scrolls through the property description, amenities, and reviews.\n548-\n549:#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n550-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n551:- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\", then changes check-in to \"2026-06-01\" and check-out to \"2026-06-05\", then changes guest count from 2 to 4 and back to 2.\n552-- **Expected:** Each change correctly updates the price breakdown. The final state shows \"2026-06-01\" to \"2026-06-05\" with 2 guests.\n553-\n--\n1048-#### Test: Step 7 — Review and publish page displayed\n1049-- **Initial state:** User completed Step 6 and clicked \"Next\".\n1050:- **Expected:** Step 7 displays a summary of all entered information: property type, title, full address (address, city, state, country), details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms), selected amenities, photo thumbnails, price per night, and cleaning fee. A \"Publish\" button and \"Back\" button are visible. The step indicator shows Step 7 of 7.\n1051-\n1052-#### Test: Step 7 — Review page shows all entered data correctly"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"febec6c6-a46f-4d38-bc02-36d34589061b","uuid":"41b69018-3db3-476a-9343-726a31c4993a","t